el":"ORP Kd","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_ki.help":"Integral gain of the ORP controller.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_ki.label":"ORP Ki","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_kp.help":"Proportional gain of the ORP controller.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_kp.label":"ORP Kp","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_min_on_ms.help":"Minimum disinfection pump injection time; shorter demands are ignored.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_min_on_ms.label":"Minimum ON time (ms)","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_pump_slot.help":"PDM slot number bound to the ORP / liquid chlorine pump.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_pump_slot.label":"Liquid chlorine pump slot","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_sample_ms.help":"ORP controller computation period.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_sample_ms.label":"PID sampling (ms)","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_setpoint.help":"Target ORP (redox) value measuring the sanitizer level in the water, shared by every disinfection mode.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_setpoint.label":"Setpoint ORP","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_window_ms.help":"PWM time window applied to the ORP pump.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dis_window_ms.label":"ORP window (ms)","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dly_electro_min.help":"Delay before salt chlorination is allowed once filtration has begun.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dly_electro_min.label":"Salt chlorination delay (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dose_ml_10m3_week.help":"Weekly liquid active oxygen dose per 10 m3.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.dose_ml_10m3_week.label":"Weekly O2 dose / 10 m3","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.last_dose_day.help":"Internal day of the last O2 injection performed.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.last_dose_day.label":"Last O2 dose day","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.load_factor.help":"Manual factor applied to the computed O2 dose.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.load_factor.label":"O2 load factor","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.main_hour.help":"Main scheduled hour for O2 dosing.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.main_hour.label":"O2 dosing hour","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.min_filter_run_min.help":"Minimum filtration runtime before O2 dosing is allowed.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.min_filter_run_min.label":"Minimum filtration for O2","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.pending_ml.help":"O2 volume still to be injected after an interruption or a reboot.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.pending_ml.label":"Pending O2","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.protocol_state.help":"Persistent state of the O2 dosing protocol.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.protocol_state.label":"O2 protocol state","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.secure_elec_t.help":"Minimum water temperature allowed for salt chlorination.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.secure_elec_t.label":"Salt chlorination safety threshold (C)","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.split_count.help":"Number of O2 injections scheduled over the week.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.split_count.label":"O2 split count","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.swg_control_mode.help":"Control mode of the salt chlorinator.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.swg_control_mode.label":"SWG control mode","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.swg_slot.help":"PDM slot number bound to the salt chlorinator.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.swg_slot.label":"Salt chlorinator slot","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.temp_comp.help":"Enables temperature compensation of the O2 dose.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.temp_comp.label":"Compensation temperature O2","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.weekly_done_ml.help":"O2 volume injected since the start of the week.","cfgdocs.poollogic.disinfection.weekly_done_ml.label":"O2 injected this week","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_en.help":"Enables filtration window 1.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_en.label":"Window 1 enabled","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_prio.help":"Fill priority of window 1 (1 = filled first).","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_prio.label":"Window 1 priority","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_start.help":"Start of window 1 in minutes since midnight (e.g. 480 = 08:00).","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_start.label":"Window 1 start (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_stop.help":"End of window 1 in minutes since midnight. An end earlier than the start makes the window cross midnight.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w1_stop.label":"Window 1 stop (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_en.help":"Enables filtration window 2 (off-peak template 23:30-07:30, priority to be adjusted).","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_en.label":"Window 2 enabled","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_prio.help":"Fill priority of window 2 (1 = filled first, useful for off-peak hours).","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_prio.label":"Window 2 priority","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_start.help":"Start of window 2 in minutes since midnight (e.g. 1410 = 23:30).","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_start.label":"Window 2 start (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_stop.help":"End of window 2 in minutes since midnight. An end earlier than the start makes the window cross midnight.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w2_stop.label":"Window 2 stop (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_en.help":"Enables filtration window 3.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_en.label":"Window 3 enabled","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_prio.help":"Fill priority of window 3 (1 = filled first).","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_prio.label":"Window 3 priority","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_start.help":"Start of window 3 in minutes since midnight.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_start.label":"Window 3 start (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_stop.help":"End of window 3 in minutes since midnight. An end earlier than the start makes the window cross midnight.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.filtr_w3_stop.label":"Window 3 stop (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.help":"Time ranges where filtration is allowed: the computed daily need is spread across them by priority.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.fenetres.label":"Windows","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_cycle_ratio.help":"Adjusts the number of daily water turnovers targeted, as a percentage of the temperature reference curve (100 % = original curve, e.g. 1 turnover/day at 22 °C). Raising it lengthens the recommended filtration time proportionally; the result is still capped by the capacity of the active windows. Range 50 to 200 %.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_cycle_ratio.label":"Cycle ratio","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_optimal_min.help":"Computed optimal filtration time (volume × turnovers(T°) ÷ flow rate), in minutes, before the active windows cap it. Automatic plan output.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_optimal_min.label":"Computed optimal duration","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_segments.help":"List of the filtration slots computed for the day, format “HH:MM-HH:MM, …”. Automatic plan output.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_segments.label":"Computed filtration slots","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_slot.help":"PDM slot number driving filtration.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_slot.label":"Filtration slot","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_start_clc.help":"Automatically computed start time of the main filtration segment.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_start_clc.label":"Computed filtration start","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_stop_clc.help":"Automatically computed end time of the main filtration segment.","cfgdocs.poollogic.filtration.filtr_stop_clc.label":"Computed filtration stop","cfgdocs.poollogic.heater.heater_auto_mode.help":"Enables automatic water temperature regulation through the heater.","cfgdocs.poollogic.heater.heater_auto_mode.label":"Auto mode heating","cfgdocs.poollogic.heater.heater_setpoint.help":"Target water temperature for heater regulation.","cfgdocs.poollogic.heater.heater_setpoint.label":"Setpoint heating (C)","cfgdocs.poollogic.heater.heater_slot.help":"PDM slot number bound to the water heater.","cfgdocs.poollogic.heater.heater_slot.label":"Slot heating","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_auto_mode.help":"Enable automatic of pH.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_auto_mode.label":"Auto mode pH","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_deadband.help":"Error below which no dosing is triggered. Prevents injecting on probe noise (±0.02 to 0.05 pH).","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_deadband.label":"Deadband","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_factor.help":"Fraction of the error targeted per batch (0.5 = correct half of it). A value below 1 guarantees convergence without overshoot despite the recirculation delay.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_factor.label":"Safety factor","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_max_batch.help":"Cap on a single injection. Limits how large a correction can be when the error is high or the gain is mis-calibrated.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_max_batch.label":"Maximum volume per batch (mL)","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_max_day.help":"Daily volumetric safety limit. The counter is the pump's own injected volume for the day and survives a reboot.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_max_day.label":"Maximum volume per day (mL)","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_ml_m3.help":"Millilitres of corrector per m³ of water to move the pH by 0.1. Typical order of magnitude: 10 mL/m³ for 33 % hydrochloric acid at 100 mg/L total alkalinity. Used as a starting value: the controller then calibrates itself from the measured effect.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_ml_m3.label":"Dosing gain (mL/m³)","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_plus.help":"When enabled, the pH pump injects pH-plus instead of pH-minus.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_dose_plus.label":"pH-plus injection","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_gain_learned.help":"Gain auto-calibrated from previous batches, bounded to ±50 % of the configured gain. 0 = not learned yet. Reset when the reference gain or the pool volume changes.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_gain_learned.label":"Learned gain (mL/m³)","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_gain_samples.help":"Number of batches folded into the learned gain.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_gain_samples.label":"Calibration samples","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_last_dose_ts.help":"End of the last injected batch, used to resume the mixing wait after a reboot.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_last_dose_ts.label":"Last batch timestamp","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_mix_wait_min.help":"Wait after a batch before measuring again. 0 = computed automatically from pool volume and filtration flow (one full turnover). A non-zero value acts as a floor.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_mix_wait_min.label":"Mixing wait (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_no_effect_dph.help":"Below this pH change after a batch, the injection is considered to have had no effect.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_no_effect_dph.label":"Minimum significant change","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_no_effect_lots.help":"Number of consecutive batches with no measurable correction before raising the “dosing has no effect” alarm (empty tank, punctured tubing, stuck probe).","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_no_effect_lots.label":"Batches without effect before alarm","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_pump_slot.help":"PDM slot number bound to the pH pump.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_pump_slot.label":"Slot pump pH","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_sample_max_age.help":"Maximum age of the pH reading used to decide a batch. Beyond it, dosing is suspended until a fresh reading arrives.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_sample_max_age.label":"Required freshness (s)","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_setpoint.help":"Target pH value for regulation.","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_setpoint.label":"Setpoint pH","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_valid_max.help":"Above this value the probe is considered suspect and dosing is forbidden (never maximal).","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_valid_max.label":"Valid reading: maximum","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_valid_min.help":"Below this value the probe is considered suspect and dosing is forbidden (never maximal).","cfgdocs.poollogic.ph.ph_valid_min.label":"Valid reading: minimum","cfgdocs.poollogic.refill.fill_min_on_s.help":"Minimum run time of the refill pump.","cfgdocs.poollogic.refill.fill_min_on_s.label":"Minimum refill time (s)","cfgdocs.poollogic.refill.fill_slot.help":"PDM slot number bound to the refill pump.","cfgdocs.poollogic.refill.fill_slot.label":"Refill slot","cfgdocs.poollogic.robot.robot_delay_min.help":"Delay before the cleaning robot starts automatically.","cfgdocs.poollogic.robot.robot_delay_min.label":"Robot delay (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.robot.robot_dur_min.help":"Run time of the cleaning robot.","cfgdocs.poollogic.robot.robot_dur_min.label":"Duration robot (min)","cfgdocs.poollogic.robot.robot_slot.help":"PDM slot number bound to the cleaning robot.","cfgdocs.poollogic.robot.robot_slot.label":"Robot slot","cfgdocs.poollogic.safety.freeze_hold_t.help":"Hold temperature for frost protection.","cfgdocs.poollogic.safety.freeze_hold_t.label":"Frost protection hold threshold (C)","cfgdocs.poollogic.safety.winter_start_t.help":"Water temperature that switches the automations to winter logic.","cfgdocs.poollogic.safety.winter_start_t.label":"Winter entry threshold (C)","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.air_temp_io_id.help":"IO id of the air temperature probe.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.air_temp_io_id.label":"IO temperature air","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.cover_io_id.help":"IO id of the digital input wired to the closed-cover contact.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.cover_io_id.label":"Closed-cover sensor IO","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.dis_io_id.help":"IO id of the ORP reading.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.dis_io_id.label":"ORP sensor IO","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.dis_lvl_io_id.help":"IO id of the disinfectant tank low-level digital input.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.dis_lvl_io_id.label":"Disinfectant tank level IO","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.flow_io_id.help":"IO id of the flow switch digital input (flow detection).","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.flow_io_id.label":"Flow sensor IO (flow switch)","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.ph_io_id.help":"IO id of the pH reading.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.ph_io_id.label":"pH sensor IO","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.ph_lvl_io_id.help":"IO id of the digital input for the pH tank low level.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.ph_lvl_io_id.label":"pH tank level IO","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.pool_lvl_io_id.help":"IO id of the pool level reading.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.pool_lvl_io_id.label":"Pool level IO","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.pressure_io_id.help":"IO id of the pressure sensor.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.pressure_io_id.label":"IO pressure","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.wat_temp_io_id.help":"IO id of the water temperature probe.","cfgdocs.poollogic.sensors.wat_temp_io_id.label":"Water temperature IO","cfgmods.poollogic.compose.device.label":"Bound equipment","cfgmods.poollogic.compose.disinfection.label":"Disinfection","cfgmods.poollogic.compose.pump.label":"Dosing pump","cfgmods.poollogic.compose.swg.label":"Salt chlorinator","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.0.label":"00:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.1.label":"01:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.10.label":"10:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.11.label":"11:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.12.label":"12:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.13.label":"13:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.14.label":"14:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.15.label":"15:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.16.label":"16:00","cfgmods_meta.poollogicmodule.enum_sets.hours_of_day.17.label":"17:00","cfgmods_meta